# OpenSpec

Non-trivial changes must use `openspec/changes/<name>/` (proposal, design, tasks).

- Sync or archive OpenSpec when the change is ready to keep — typically **before commit or PR**
- Do not burn a turn syncing half-baked work after every agent stop
- Skip only for trivial typos/comments/tiny docs

A `beforeShellExecution` hook may **ask** on `git commit` / `gh pr create` if code changed without OpenSpec updates. Sync artifacts, then retry.

See `openspec/config.yaml` and `AGENTS.md`.
